Allow the image's current scikit-rf and use its public Circuit import.
The dependency relaxation is proposed upstream in IIC-OSIC-TOOLS#427:
https://github.com/iic-jku/IIC-OSIC-TOOLS/issues/427#issuecomment-6819667336
The RF regression also found that scikit-rf 2.2.0 no longer exports skrf.Circuit.
Remove each hunk when the pinned source includes the corresponding change.

